<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Servicio Requerido - Black Pro</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700&family=Inter:wght@400;600&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #050505;
            --accent-color: #e1306c;
            --secondary-accent: #00ff88;
            --text-color: #ffffff;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-image:
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(225, 48, 108, 0.05) 0%, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.05) 0%, transparent 40%);
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 450px;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .icon-box {
            font-size: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px var(--accent-color));
            animation: pulse 2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% {
                transform: scale(1);
                opacity: 0.8;
            }

            50% {
                transform: scale(1.05);
                opacity: 1;
            }

            100% {
                transform: scale(1);
                opacity: 0.8;
            }
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 24px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: var(--text-color);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        p {
            color: #888;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .alert-box {
            background: rgba(225, 48, 108, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(225, 48, 108, 0.3);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #ff6ba8;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent-color), #ff6ba8);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(225, 48, 108, 0.3);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(225, 48, 108, 0.5);
        }

        .footer-text {
            margin-top: 50px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #444;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="icon-box">🛡️</div>
        <h1>Protección Requerida</h1>

        <div class="alert-box">
            Atención: El dueño de este enlace debe activar el servicio de protección para continuar.
        </div>

        <p>
            Este Smart Link está intentando utilizar funciones avanzadas de seguridad que no se encuentran activas en
            este momento.
        </p>

        <a href="https://t.me/blackproonlyfans" class="cta-button" target="_blank">
            Contactar Soporte
        </a>

        <div class="footer-text">
            BLACK PRO © 2026 | SECURE TRAFFIC SYSTEM
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>